 <iati-activity default-currency="EUR" hierarchy="2" humanitarian="0" iati-activities:version="2.03" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-EC_INTPA-2024-PC-36465</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_INTPA" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for International Partnerships</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparent and Accountable Economic Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The Overall Objective (Impact)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; of this Action is to promote public finance transparency and accountability in Guinea-Bissau. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Indeed, the Action focuses on encouraging strategic administrative reforms to consolidate the foundations of sound public financial management by strengthening budgetary discipline, ensuring efficient allocation of financial resources in line with policy priorities, and improving effective and efficient provision of public services. Additionally, the Action seeks to strengthen financial control bodies and procedures, including fostering civil society participation, to reinforce the fight against corruption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The Specific Objectives (SO)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Based on the general objective of this Action, two specific objectives have been defined, which the project aims to achieve and towards which it is oriented. These are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;SO1. To improve the effectiveness of public financial management systems, procedures, and capacities, with a gender and environmental sensitive perspective (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Outcome 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;SO2. To strengthen the framework and conditions for participation, transparency, and oversight in financial governance and the fight against corruption (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Outcome 2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Within the framework of the SO1, the expected outputs contributing are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhanced capacity of public finance stakeholders in gender and environment responsive budget and strategic planning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Expenditure programming and budgeting systems and processes are strengthened while taking into gender and environment perspectives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Systems and processes for expenditure execution, procurement and internal control are enhanced.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Within the framework of the SO2, the expected outputs contributing are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Public and equal access to information on public finances is promoted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhanced capacity of the Parliament, the Court of Auditors and civil society for oversight of public finance management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improved mechanisms for fighting against corruption.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
